{"id":"f267483f66bfb134","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-mv-algebra.md","title":"MV-Algebra","display":"df-mv-algebra — MV-Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-mv-algebra","aliases":["93-df-mv-algebra"],"display":"df-mv-algebra — MV-Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-mv-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-mv-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mv-algebra — MV-Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf M\">\\(\\mathbf M\\)</span> is an algebra candidate with prospective basic symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus,\\neg,0\">\\(\\oplus,\\neg,0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is sourced from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}\">\\(S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\">\\(\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\">\\(\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot^{\\mathbf M}\">\\(\\odot^{\\mathbf M}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf M}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf M}\\)</span> are the nullary-operation value, derived top, derived operation, and order defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{MV}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\oplus,\\neg,0\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(\\oplus)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(\\neg)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{MV}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\oplus,\\neg,0\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(\\oplus)&amp;\\coloneqq2,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(\\neg)\\coloneqq1,\\qquad\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}(0)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}}(\\mathbf M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf M|\\;\\Bigl[\n(a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b)\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}c\n=a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}(b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b=b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a\n\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)=a\n\\land\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a)=a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\n=\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b)\n\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b\n=\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a)\n\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MVAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}}(\\mathbf M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf M|\\;\\Bigl[\n(a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b)\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}c\n=a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}(b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b=b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a\n\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)=a\n\\land\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a)=a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\n=\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b)\n\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b\n=\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}b\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a)\n\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}a\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\coloneqq\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M),\\qquad\na\\odot^{\\mathbf M}b\\coloneqq\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\neg^{\\mathbf M}b)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\coloneqq\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M),\\qquad\na\\odot^{\\mathbf M}b\\coloneqq\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}(\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}\\neg^{\\mathbf M}b)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\na\\leq_{\\mathbf M}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in|\\mathbf M|\\land\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b=\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\na\\leq_{\\mathbf M}b\\leftrightarrow\na,b\\in|\\mathbf M|\\land\n\\neg^{\\mathbf M}a\\oplus^{\\mathbf M}b=\\operatorname{OneMV}_{93}(\\mathbf M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mv\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{MV}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{MV}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MV algebras are now genuine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{MV}}\\)</span>-algebras, so the general homomorphism and isomorphism predicates apply without an implicit signature conversion. Since the interpretation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> is a function graph on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf M|^0\">\\(|\\mathbf M|^0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ZeroMV}_{93}\\)</span> first evaluates it at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>; the order is then the standard term-defined MV order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"r